[Music]  last saturday the dc fandom took place  one more time like last year the digital  event was able to impress with some  brand new trailers as well as news about  the upcoming dc blockbusters one of the  highlights besides the big titles like  the batman or black adam was the bad  girl series fans were unfortunately not  treated to a trailer but there were  details about the story and the first  glimpse of the super heroine outfit the  concept arc shows the female protagonist  standing on a kind of gargoyle and  glooming gotham city setting  additionally christina hudson chatted a  bit about this story of batgirl  according to her the lead character  whose real name is barbara gordon will  become batgirl only in the course of the  series and as a result she'll be  exploring the duality between the normal  barbara and her other ego batgirl the  team behind the series is definitely  confident and also a little excited as  the two belgian directors adelel arby  and bilal falar reiterated during the  panel the two had most recently directed  bad boys for life we are eager to see  the final result but unfortunately there  is still more information about the  release date  it has been 21 years since one of the  greatest science fiction movies ever  made its theatrical debut of course we  are referring to the matrix franchise  which has had a tremendous impact not  only on cinema audiences but also on pop  culture in general later this year the  fourth installment titled the matrix  resurrections is scheduled to be  released and now that a teaser and a  trailer have already been published  there is more information regarding the  plot much to the joy of many fans the  movie will completely disregard the two  sequels to the original and will take  place directly after part one as can be  gathered from a statement by warner  brothers on their website in addition we  can expect a new and above all much more  powerful matrix than in the first movie  the official description states that  thomas anderson will once again have to  follow the white rabbit the matrix is  described as being stronger safer and  more dangerous than ever before this  sounds exciting and is anything but  surprising since the matrix must have  learned from the events of the first  part and is therefore even more  difficult to defeat we're looking  forward to the matrix resurrections  which is expected to hit theaters on  december 22 2021. what do you think  about the latest news are you content  with the fact that it picks up directly  after the first part or would you have  liked to see more coverage on the events  from the matrix reloaded and the matrix  revolutions let us know in the comments  the john wick series is probably one of  the most popular action franchises of  all time although john wick chapter 3  will be followed by the fourth part of  the movies next year a prequel is also  in production apart from the main series  more precisely the project is a  three-part mini-series called the  continental the plot is set around 40  years before the first john wick part  and focuses on the early life of the  later continental leader winston scott  due to his age 79 year old ian mcshane  will obviously not be playing the young  winston instead 29 year old the perch  actor colin woodle has been cast the  plot revolves around the infamous  continental hotel which the young  winston wants to take over in the 1970s  alongside woodle we will also be  introduced to hollywood star male gibson  in the role of mob boss cormack needless  to say we cannot expect ken reeves to  make an appearance considering that his  story from the film series takes place a  few decades later the series will be  released in three 90-minute episodes and  is scheduled for release as early as  next year  millions of fans around the world are  anxiously waiting the third spiderman  movie starring tom holland which will  come out later this year in addition to  tom holland the marvel multiverse  spectacle is not only expected to  feature three spider-man but will also  feature the return of all villains from  the various spider-man franchises  including the main antagonists dog  electro sandman and green goblin  that being said the movie also marks the  end of the mcu film trilogy from the  friendly neighborhood spider tom holland  commented on this and other details of  no way home in an interview with  entertainment weekly the 25 year old  stated that no way home will definitely  be the end of the series besides he's  looking forward to the revival of the  countless characters from the  predecessors and chances that he found  the shooting of what is expected to be  his last mcu solo film very emotional  with spider-man no way home peter parker  will not only have to face a whole bunch  of villains he will also have to cope  with the fact that the entire world  knows his identity being anything but  well disposed towards him as a way out  of this dilemma he turns to his friend  doctor strange however when the latter  tries to fix the mess things only worsen  at the aforementioned multiverse is  created but not only regarding the story  is their new knowledge because as  various reports suggests we should  finally get to see a new trailer this  month this piece of news comes from an  extremely reliable insider who has often  published reasonable speculations on  twitter under the name spider leaks he  argues with the fact that the uncharted  trailer was released this week making  sony reluctant to promote two big movies  in one week you always have to take such  rumors with a grain of salt of course  but given the circumstances we are  pretty optimistic that the next week  will indeed mark the release of the  second trailer spider-man no way home is  scheduled for release on december 17  2021  one might have thought that the time of  large-scale film postponements had  slowly but surely come to an end  unfortunately this is not the case  because now disney is postponing a whole  bunch of new movies among others the mcu  blockbuster is doctor strange and the  multiverse of madness and black panther  wakanda forever are affected well the  former will now be released on may 6  2022 instead of march fans of black  panther will have to wait an additional  2 months until november 11th fans of  indiana jones 5 will suffer considerably  more however the sequel starring  harrison ford will no longer be released  in the summer of 2022 but on june 30th  2023  that's nearly a whole year later than  last planned other new releases are thor  love and thunder on july 8 2022 the  marvels on february 17 2023 and ant-man  and the wasp quantomania on july 28 2023  disney cites various production delays  as the reason of course this primarily  affects the marvel films which are known  to be linked and build on each other  after tennis star director christopher  nolan is already in the process of  filming his next masterpiece the  blockbuster is to be called oppenheimer  and recounts the story of the atomic  bomb at the very center of the event is  the eponymous u.s physicist robert  oppenheimer who was entrusted with the  management of the infamous manhattan  project during the second world war and  is thereby considered the father of the  atomic bomb this is an extremely  gripping topic that nolan would like to  cover in his upcoming film as of a few  days ago the two main actors have also  been confirmed because while the signing  of cillian murphy is robin oppenheimer  has been known for some time the cast of  the female elite has only recently been  announced the person in question is of  course very familiar to every movie gore  as her name is emily blunt the 28 year  old recently thrilled millions of fans  in disney's jungle cruise and became  world famous thanks to the two acquired  place films at the very latest in  oppenheimer she placed the protagonist  to wife who certainly had a great  influence on her husband's success in  terms of content the movie is based on  the book american prometheus the triumph  and tragedy of j robert oppenheimer  which focuses not only on the work on  the atomic bomb but also in  oppenheimer's private life shooting will  start at the beginning of next year with  the film expected to release on july 21  2023  one of the highlights this week was  definitely their first uncharted trailer  do not hesitate to watch the first  scenes of the video game adaption and  best quality on our channel further do  not forget to keep your eyes peeled next  week because there's a good chance that  we will be able to present the brand new  trailer for spider-man no way home  [Music]

